# T114 (story 3): app-02 has an update (1.2.0 to 1.3.0): the row says so, Update shows the plan, the data folder is kept.
# scenario demo
# expect-file system/app-02/user.txt
# expect-file applications/app-02.bin
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
expect rowState Update available (1.2.0
tap appRow 1
waitfor detailState Update available
expect detailInstalled 1.2.0
expect detailOffered 1.3.0
tap actionUpdate
waitfor planSummary Update App app-02 from 1.2.0 to 1.3.0
tap consent 0
tap consent 1
tap confirm
waitfor resultText
expect resultText App app-02 is installed
expect resultText Its data was kept
shot @OUT@/30-update-result.png
tap ok
waitfor appRow
quit
